[h2]Build 0.9.7[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The power suit is redrawn to read clearly at normal zoom, the way the warcaskets do: a big round diving helmet with a bold amber visor band, a chin grille and a miner's lamp, big smooth shoulder plates, a very thick outline and no fiddly small details. From behind, two glowing power cells flank the release wheel.
[/list]
